<Layout title="Roadmap" active="roadmap"><section class="wrap section prose"><div class="eyebrow">Where it goes next</div><h1>Useful now. Open-ended later.</h1><p class="muted">The roadmap is directional, not a promise.</p><div class="grid"><div class="card"><h3>V1 · shipped</h3><p class="muted">Assets, components, locations, racks, networking, relationships, projects, authentication, and MCP.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Post-V1</h3><p class="muted">Potential improvements to workflows, integrations, and operational visibility.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Ideas</h3><p class="muted">Monitoring, discovery, DNS, DHCP, VLANs, configuration management, vendor integrations, and cable inventory are not V1 capabilities.</p></div></div></section></Layout>
